   "heading": "Testimonials",
   "paragraphs": [
    "Whether you’re looking to build new, remodel, buy, or sell, our team is here to help you every step of the way. Trust our expertise to create your perfect, personalized space.",
    "Let's Work Together",
    "Ready to begin your journey? We’d love to hear about your project! Reach out to us to see if we’re a good fit.",
    "CONSULTATION",
    "We start with a detailed session to understand your goals and vision, whether it’s building, remodeling, buying, renting, or selling. We listen closely, asking relevant questions to capture your vision and requirements fully and tailor our approach to your needs.",
    "COLLABORATION",
    "After gathering insights in the consultation, it’s time for collaborative brainstorming. Our team will work closely with you, pooling creativity to craft a tailored plan. Be it designing, renovating, buying, renting, or selling, collaboration is pivotal. Your input shapes the final plan, surpassing expectations.",
    "EXECUTION",
    "With consultation and collaboration complete, it’s time to execute. We bring your vision to life, managing every detail. Whether it’s new construction, renovations, property transactions, or sales, we handle it all. Our focus is on delivering results that exceed your expectations, ensuring a successful outcome.",
    "Begin Your Journey Here",
    "Founded by Luke Caldwell of HGTV’s “Boise Boys,” Timber + Love specializes in real estate, home remodeling, and new builds. Since 2015, we’ve been transforming spaces with innovative design and unique craftsmanship, offering full-service solutions for buying, selling, or building your dream home."
   ],
